#: fprintd-manager:692 fprintd-manager:1473
msgid "fprintd Fingerprint Manager"
msgstr "Gestor de huellas fprintd"

#: fprintd-manager:710
msgid "Refresh status"
msgstr "Actualizar estado"

#: fprintd-manager:718
msgid "About this app"
msgstr "Acerca de esta aplicación"

#: fprintd-manager:799
msgid "Welcome! Let's set up your fingerprint"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido! Configuremos su huella"

#: fprintd-manager:801
msgid ""
"Your fingerprint scanner is connected and the driver is installed.\n"
"\n"
"To start using fingerprint login, you need to enroll a finger. Follow the "
"prompts to touch the scanner repeatedly.\n"
"\n"
"By default, your RIGHT INDEX FINGER will be enrolled. If you're left-handed, "
"you can change the finger in the dropdown below the Enroll button.\n"
"\n"
"Click 'Start Enrollment' to begin — then place your finger on the scanner "
"when prompted."
msgstr ""
"Su lector de huellas está conectado y el controlador está instalado.\n"
"\n"
"Para empezar a iniciar sesión con la huella, debe registrar un dedo. Siga "
"las indicaciones y toque el lector varias veces.\n"
"\n"
"De forma predeterminada se registrará su ÍNDICE DERECHO. Si es zurdo, puede "
"cambiar el dedo en la lista desplegable bajo el botón «Registrar».\n"
"\n"
"Pulse «Iniciar registro» y coloque el dedo en el lector cuando se le indique."

#: fprintd-manager:809
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Más tarde"

#: fprintd-manager:810
msgid "Start Enrollment"
msgstr "Iniciar registro"

#: fprintd-manager:845
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Developed by {author}"
msgstr "Desarrollado por {author}"

#: fprintd-manager:848
msgid "Source and issues on GitHub"
msgstr "Código fuente e incidencias en GitHub"

#: fprintd-manager:853
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"fprintd Fingerprint Manager v{version} — MIT licensed. Uses the system "
"fprintd and libfprint packages."
msgstr ""
"Gestor de huellas fprintd v{version} — con licencia MIT. Usa los paquetes "
"del sistema fprintd y libfprint."

#: fprintd-manager:888 fprintd-manager:915 fprintd-manager:1380
msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Comprobando…"

#: fprintd-manager:897
msgid "Scanner"
msgstr "Lector"

#: fprintd-manager:898
msgid "Driver"
msgstr "Controlador"

#: fprintd-manager:899
msgid "Fingers"
msgstr "Dedos"

#: fprintd-manager:908
msgid "Fingerprint Enrollment"
msgstr "Registro de huella"

#: fprintd-manager:909
msgid "Touch the scanner repeatedly when prompted by fprintd"
msgstr "Toque el lector varias veces cuando fprintd se lo indique"

#: fprintd-manager:914
msgid "Enrollment Status"
msgstr "Estado del registro"

#: fprintd-manager:923
msgid "Finger to enroll"
msgstr "Dedo a registrar"

#: fprintd-manager:943 fprintd-manager:1696
msgid "Enroll"
msgstr "Registrar"

#: fprintd-manager:947
msgid "Test Verify"
msgstr "Probar verificación"

#: fprintd-manager:951 fprintd-manager:1205
msgid "Delete All"
msgstr "Eliminar todo"

#: fprintd-manager:955 fprintd-manager:971 fprintd-manager:1204
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancelar"

#: fprintd-manager:967
msgid "Fingerprints already enrolled"
msgstr "Ya hay huellas registradas"

#: fprintd-manager:968
msgid ""
"You already have fingerprints enrolled. Enrolling a new finger will add to "
"the existing ones. To start fresh, delete all first."
msgstr ""
"Ya tiene huellas registradas. Registrar un dedo nuevo lo añadirá a las "
"existentes. Para empezar de cero, elimínelas todas primero."

#: fprintd-manager:972 fprintd-manager:1688
msgid "Add Another Finger"
msgstr "Añadir otro dedo"

#: fprintd-manager:993
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Preparing {finger}…"
msgstr "Preparando: {finger}…"

#: fprintd-manager:1008
msgid "Deletion failed"
msgstr "Error al eliminar"

#: fprintd-manager:1013
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Enrolling {finger}… Touch the scanner NOW"
msgstr "Registrando: {finger}… Toque el lector AHORA"

#: fprintd-manager:1029 fprintd-manager:1081
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "Cancelado"

#: fprintd-manager:1040
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Touch {count} — good, keep going!"
msgstr "Toque {count}: bien, ¡siga así!"

#: fprintd-manager:1045 fprintd-manager:1106
msgid "Enrollment complete!"
msgstr "¡Registro completado!"

#: fprintd-manager:1051
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Touch {count} — bad read, try again"
msgstr "Toque {count}: lectura incorrecta, inténtelo de nuevo"

#: fprintd-manager:1057
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Touch {count} — too short, hold longer"
msgstr "Toque {count}: demasiado corto, mantenga más tiempo"

#: fprintd-manager:1063
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Touch {count} — center your finger"
msgstr "Toque {count}: centre el dedo"

#: fprintd-manager:1069
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Touch {count} — lift and touch again"
msgstr "Toque {count}: levante y vuelva a tocar"

#: fprintd-manager:1072
msgid "Enrollment failed — try again"
msgstr "Error en el registro: inténtelo de nuevo"

#: fprintd-manager:1075
msgid "Storage full — delete old prints first"
msgstr "Almacenamiento lleno: elimine primero huellas antiguas"

#: fprintd-manager:1082
msgid "Enrollment ended without completion"
msgstr "El registro terminó sin completarse"

#: fprintd-manager:1086
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Error: {error}"
msgstr "Error: {error}"

#: fprintd-manager:1102 fprintd-manager:1129
msgid "Enrollment saved."
msgstr "Registro guardado."

#: fprintd-manager:1107
msgid ""
"Fingerprint recorded successfully.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to do a quick verification touch to confirm your fingerprint "
"is working?"
msgstr ""
"Huella registrada correctamente.\n"
"\n"
"¿Desea hacer una verificación rápida para confirmar que su huella funciona?"

#: fprintd-manager:1111
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Omitir"

#: fprintd-manager:1112
msgid "Verify Now"
msgstr "Verificar ahora"

#: fprintd-manager:1124
msgid "Touch the scanner once to verify…"
msgstr "Toque el lector una vez para verificar…"

#: fprintd-manager:1125
msgid "Verification — touch the scanner once…"
msgstr "Verificación: toque el lector una vez…"

#: fprintd-manager:1128
msgid "Enrollment saved — you're all set!"
msgstr "Registro guardado: ¡todo listo!"

#: fprintd-manager:1150
msgid "Fingerprint verified! Everything is working."
msgstr "¡Huella verificada! Todo funciona."

#: fprintd-manager:1152
msgid "Fingerprint verified! You're all set."
msgstr "¡Huella verificada! Todo listo."

#: fprintd-manager:1154
msgid "Verification failed — try Test Verify again"
msgstr ""
"Error en la verificación: vuelva a intentarlo con «Probar verificación»"

#: fprintd-manager:1156
msgid "Verification didn't match — try again with Test Verify"
msgstr "No hubo coincidencia: inténtelo de nuevo con «Probar verificación»"

#: fprintd-manager:1174
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Verifying {finger} — touch the scanner…"
msgstr "Verificando: {finger}. Toque el lector…"

#: fprintd-manager:1181
msgid "Fingerprint verified!"
msgstr "¡Huella verificada!"

#: fprintd-manager:1183
msgid "No match — try again or re-enroll"
msgstr "Sin coincidencia: inténtelo de nuevo o vuelva a registrar"

#: fprintd-manager:1185
msgid "Verification timed out"
msgstr "Se agotó el tiempo de verificación"

#: fprintd-manager:1201
msgid "Delete all fingerprints?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar todas las huellas?"

#: fprintd-manager:1202
msgid "You will need to re-enroll after deletion."
msgstr "Tendrá que volver a registrarse tras eliminarlas."

#: fprintd-manager:1240
