#: fprintd-manager:1484
msgid ""
"Fingerprint manager for readers supported by fprintd on Linux.\n"
"\n"
"Adapted from chipsailing-cs9711-fingerprint-linux for the packaged fprintd "
"service. Thank you to Mahmud Farooque and the upstream contributors. The "
"original GUI is MIT licensed. The upstream community libfprint driver is "
"LGPL-2.1-or-later, from the archeYR/libfprint-CS9711 community fork."
msgstr ""
"Gestor de huellas para lectores compatibles con fprintd en Linux.\n"
"\n"
"Adaptado de chipsailing-cs9711-fingerprint-linux para el servicio fprintd "
"empaquetado. Gracias a Mahmud Farooque y a los colaboradores originales. La "
"interfaz original tiene licencia MIT. El controlador comunitario de "
"libfprint original tiene licencia LGPL-2.1-or-later y procede del fork "
"comunitario archeYR/libfprint-CS9711."

